# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Weapon_ARMA_X .gitignore
#
# This repository is the TOOLS repo. It contains no gameplay resources, so no
# ignore rule here may ever match an Enfusion resource extension. See the guard
# section at the bottom.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Temporary / generated files not part of the deliverable catalog
agent/scripts/working_tables/
agent/scripts/_inspect.py
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Agent scratch output. Default destination for anything a tool or agent
# produces (audit dumps, diagnostics, scratch scripts, plans, traces).
# See AGENTS.md rule 5 and artifacts/README.md.
# The README is tracked so the directory is self-documenting.
artifacts/*
!artifacts/README.md

# Local, machine-specific addon path override (addon_path.py candidate #3).
# Never commit an absolute local path.
addon_path.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GUARD: gameplay resource extensions must never be ignored here.
#
# If a future ignore rule would hide any of the following, that rule is wrong
# for this repository and must be removed. The live addon is the source of
# truth for these; this repo must never be used as a shadow copy of it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# *.et
# *.meta
# *.conf
# *.ct
# *.layer
# *.ent
# *.xob
# *.fbx
# *.agr
# *.asi
# *.anm
# *.emat
# *.edds
# *.ogg
# *.wem
# *.gproj
